# Copy this file to `.env` and paste the values from your Firebase project:
# Firebase console -> Project settings -> General -> Your apps -> SDK setup and configuration -> Config
#
# These keys are not secrets. Firebase web API keys are safe to ship in a browser
# bundle; what actually protects your data is the Firestore security rules in
# firestore.rules. Never rely on hiding these values.
#
# Leave this file unfilled and the landing page still runs off its bundled
# content — only the admin dashboard and the contact form need Firebase.

